# Ignore SQLite database + WAL/SHM sidecar files in the dev file watcher.
#
# The app resolves DATABASE_URL=forge-pos.db relative to the src-tauri CWD, so
# SQLite (in WAL mode) creates forge-pos.db / -wal / -shm inside src-tauri/.
# These files churn on every connection open, and Tauri's `tauri dev` watcher
# would otherwise treat each change as a source change and trigger an endless
# "Rebuilding application..." loop.
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
*.db.backup
